~ start
You head deeper into the University, past past the classrooms and common areas, until you find the Alchemy Department. The old saw about alchemy being the magic of explosions has a bit of evidence here and there - a cracked window, or a bit of soot on a door. Thankfully, the Skybound Alembic isn't used for energetic reactions... Usually. 
After asking a passing student for directions, you find it in a purpose-built lab standing a bit apart from the rest of the department.  
~ Mid


